{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56555","headline":"还丹口诀 · 杨真人","name":"还丹口诀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淮王炼秋石，黄帝美金花。\n世人不悟莫咨嗟，神仙之药徧中华。\n不用铅，不用砂，迷愚之者亦如麻。\n修取铅，炼取砂，顷刻之间见黄芽。\n得黄芽，莫谩夸，将此黄芽配女家，夫妻和合岁月赊。\n身披紫服驾云霞，验之刀圭是河车。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨真人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56555.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56555","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}